@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<div class="sv-card mt-4">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Solvia is a demo built for the PayPal AI Hackathon. Every student in
        it is fictional, every payment is PayPal sandbox test money, and no
        real personal data is collected or stored.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        The AI that reads a student's answers (Microsoft Phi-4-mini) runs
        100% locally on the same computer via Ollama. Student answers never
        leave the machine, are never sent to a cloud model, and are never
        used to train any model — that is impossible by design, not just a
        promise.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5 mb-0">
        The public permit check (<code>/verify</code>) shows only what a
        parking officer needs — whether a permit number is valid — and
        never another student's information.
    </p>
</div>
